tching debtors desperately try to sink their balls into","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:55:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944410-1846018067940505","game_id":"steam-4944410","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Tutorial Overhaul & Score Zone Experiment","summary":"Hello, dear debtors — this is Kniv Studio.The onboarding improvements we promised in our last roundup are here. And the score zones — the thing you've told us about the most — are getting a big change too.🎓 Tutorial OverhaulThe tutorial has been rebuilt from the ground up.It now covers the fundamentals hands-on: controlling launch power, how Reset Pegs work, and buying and moving balls and pieces in the shop yourself.A controls guide has been added to the settings menu.⚪ Score Zone ReworkWe stil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:08:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940505","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944410-1845383656385335","game_id":"steam-4944410","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Patches So Far","summary":"Hello, dear debtors — this is Kniv Studio.Since launch, we've been quietly folding your feedback into the demo through a series of hotfixes. The tutorial overhaul we mentioned earlier is going to take a little longer, so we figured it was time to round up everything we've shipped so far.🔄 Reset Peg ReworkWhy we adjusted the Reset PegOur ideal is clear: when the board you carefully built comes together, the dopamine should hit all at once — and you should feel that your strategy made it happen. W","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T08:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385335","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944410-1844751498233923","game_id":"steam-4944410","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO OUT NOW! + Some immediate hotfixes","summary":"The Demo Is Out! 🐰 Our First Hotfix Hey there, debtors! The High Roller Penny demo is out now! ✨ What’s in the Demo? All kinds of balls — Big balls, small balls, Bowling Balls, and Bouncy Balls! Pieces with a twist — Blue pieces, Shockwave Pegs, Cloner Pegs that duplicate balls, and Jump Springs that send them flying! And most importantly… A new bunny girl, Leona, ready to hand you a crushing defeat! Enjoying the demo? Leave a review and let Penny know! 🩷🐰 For future updates and news about upcom","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T11:22:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233923","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4944410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:34Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4944410":"2026-10-26T05:32:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4944410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5207160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4944410","app_id":4944410,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR",